nd occupation - B) Age and sex - C) Race and income - D) Education and geographic location - **Answer: B**","type":"Short Answer","subject":"Internal Medicine","topic":"Respiratory","topicOriginal":"Respiratory","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":[],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Internal Medicine","displayTopic":"Respiratory","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":[],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-1e46063e28bf","stem":"**What impact of COPD on physical capital accumulation was considered in the study?** - A) Increase in healthcare infrastructure - B) Impact of COPD treatment costs - C) Rise in medical research funding - D) Growth in pharmaceutical industry - **Answer: B**","type":"Short Answer","subject":"Internal Medicine","topic":"Respiratory","topicOriginal":"Respiratory","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":[],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Internal Medicine","displayTopic":"Respiratory","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":[],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-ed26b8f421ae","stem":"**What are the primary sources of data used in the study?** - A) Clinical trials - B) Public health records and literature - C) Patient interviews - D) Experimental studies - **Answer: B**","type":"Short Answer","subject":"Internal Medicine","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Internal Medicine","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"pu