nford University - D) Yale University - **Answer: A**","type":"Short Answer","subject":"Internal Medicine","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Internal Medicine","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-bcff157aed1f","stem":"**What is the publication year of the study?** - A) 2020 - B) 2021 - C) 2023 - D) 2024 - **Answer: C**","type":"Short Answer","subject":"Internal Medicine","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Internal Medicine","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-50072ba41a25","stem":"**Which economic measure is primarily used to assess the burden of COPD in the study?** - A) Unemployment rate - B) Gross Domestic Product (GDP) - C) Inflation rate - D) National debt - **Answer: B**","type":"Short Answer","subject":"Internal Medicine","topic":"Respiratory","topicOriginal":"Respiratory","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":[],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Internal Medicine","displayTopic":"Respiratory","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":[],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-191e046cba70","stem":"**What does COPD stand for?** - A) Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease - B) Chronic Osteoporosis and Pulmonary Disorder - C) Chronic Obesity and Pancreatic Disease - D) Chronic Oncological Pulmonary Disease - **Answer: A**","type":"Short Answer","subject":"Internal Medicine","topic":"Respiratory","topicOriginal":"Respiratory","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":[],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Internal Medicine","displayTopic":"Respiratory","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":[],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-af9f8e7ac199","stem":"**According to the study, investments in effective COPD interventions can result in what type of returns?** - A) Negative returns - B) Minimal returns - C) Substantial economic returns - D) No returns - **Answer: C**","type":"Short Answer","subject":"Internal Medicine","topic":"Respiratory","topicOriginal":"Respiratory","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":[],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Internal Medicine","displayTopic":"Respiratory","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":[],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-fe3a1e8e08b8","stem":"**How does the study propose to reduce the economic burden of COPD?** - A) Increasing healthcare costs - B) Investing in effective interventions - C) Reducing taxes - D) Decreasing labor supply - **Answer: B**","type":"Short Answer","subject":"Internal Medicine","topic":"Respiratory","topicOriginal":"Respiratory","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":[],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Internal Medicine","displayTopic":"Respiratory","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjud